    "summary": "While every unit in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of an enemy unit is a **FORTIFICATION** unit:\n\n- the enemy unit can be picked as the target of ranged attacks\n- ranged attacks against it get -1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls), unless they are **[[CLOSE-QUARTERS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/close-quarters)** attacks\n- whenever it is picked for a [Fall-back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back) while not **battle-shocked**, its [hazard rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hazard-rolls) pass automatically",
